Document Linux build dependencies for signalsmith-stretch

The signalsmith-stretch crate uses bindgen to generate Rust bindings from
C++ headers, which requires libclang. On minimal Linux systems, this can
fail with "'stddef.h' file not found" even when build-essential is installed.

The fix is to install clang and libclang-dev, which provides the headers
that bindgen/libclang needs to parse C++ code.

